invalid type: string "on your computer now, it will only contain \"Mango\".\n9.4 Appending to a File ('a')\nIf you want to keep \"Apple\" and \"Orange\" but add \"Banana\" to the list, use Append mode.\nCode Example:\nf = open(\"fruits.txt\", \"a\")\n\nf.write(\"Banana\") # Adds Banana to the end\n\nf.close()\n9.5 Common Errors\n1. FileNotFoundError: Trying to read a file that doesn't exist.\nÿÿÿÿ